.SS "delegate \fBCompareResult\fP SystemEx\&.Utils\&.CompFunc< T > (T? a, T? b)"

.PP
Represents a comparison function for two values of type \fIT\fP \&. The function receives two operands \fRa\fP and \fRb\fP and returns a \fBCompareResult\fP describing their ordering relation\&. This delegate is used throughout Algorithm to implement generic, type‑agnostic algorithms such as sorting, min/max selection, and lexicographical comparison\&. 

.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The value type to compare\&.
.RE
.PP
